---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Bearagnostic"
  description="Bearagnostic is a privacy-first Android file clarity assistant from Benedict Interactive."
>
  <section class="page-hero shell product-page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Benedict Interactive / Android</p>
    <div class="product-title-lockup">
      <span class="bear-dot" aria-hidden="true">B</span>
      <h1>Bearagnostic</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="product-page-promise">Find clutter. Explain the risk. Clean with confidence.</p>
    <p>
      Bearagnostic is designed to help people understand storage clutter before deleting it,
      with a calm interface, clear explanations, and privacy-first behavior.
    </p>
    <span class="status-pill standalone">In development</span>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell feature-grid">
    <article class="content-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Clarity</p>
      <h2>Explain before acting.</h2>
      <p>
        File-cleaning software should help a person understand what was found, why it matters,
        and what can be removed safely.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="content-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h2>Local-first by principle.</h2>
      <p>
        The product direction prioritizes local analysis and avoids pretending to provide
        benefits it cannot verify.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="content-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Experience</p>
      <h2>Friendly without feeling childish.</h2>
      <p>
        Bearagnostic can be more playful than the Benedict corporate layer while still sharing
        the same standards for typography, spacing, truthfulness, and polish.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
